pi-teach - https://github.com/joshrnoll/pi-teach

`src/client/anchor.js` is derived from pi-teach's `assets/runtime/anchor.mjs`
(the text-quote selector shape and the context-scoring fallback), and the theme
cascade in `src/chrome.css` follows the approach in its `assets/runtime/theme.mjs`
and `classroom.css`. Both are reimplemented rather than copied verbatim; the
design is theirs.

